{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42995","headline":"赠窦蔡二记室入蜀 · 陈政","name":"赠窦蔡二记室入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崑山积良宝，大厦构衆材。\n马卿委官去，邹子背淮来。\n风流信多美，朝夕豫平台。\n逸翮独不羣，清才复遒上。\n六辅昔推名，二江今振响。\n英华虽外发，磨琢终内朗。\n四海奋羽仪，清风久播驰。\n沈郁林难厕，青山翻易阻。\n回首望烟霞，谁知慕俦侣。\n飘然不系舟，爲情自可求。\n若奉西园夜，浩想北园愁。\n无因逐萍藻，从尔泛清流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈政","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}